          "title": "“捞人”背后的连环骗局｜小辛漫闻",
          "url": "https://mini.caixin.com/2026-09-20/102486719.html",
          "published": "Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:35:49 +0800",
          "summary": "<div id=\"intro\">\t\t\t<img id=\"introBG\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/01.jpg\" /> \t\t</div>\t\t<div id=\"articleTips\">\t\t\t<div id=\"innerTipsTitle\"><a class=\"innerTipsTitleText\"></a><a class=\"innerTipsTitleLine\"></a></div>\t\t\t<div id=\"innerTipsCon\"></div>\t\t</div>\t\t<div id=\"mainContent\">\t\t\t<div id=\"mainArticle\">\t\t\t\t<div id=\"authorGroup\">\t\t\t\t\t<img id=\"cxLogoHead\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/common/images/editorIcon.png\" /> \t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"author_3\"></a> \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"splitLineHead\"></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<p class=\"yinyu\"></p> \t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/01.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageText\">创意制作：凌筠</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">【背景参考】2023年，内蒙古商人甘德胜曾帮忙“捞人”，他受托为福建人王一湖的亲属办理取保，当时这名亲属因涉嫌开设赌场罪被逮捕。甘德胜称，一名叫陈英的女子说可以办这事，需要100万元。王一湖将钱打到甘德胜指定账户，甘德胜随即将钱转给陈英的女儿。后续因为对方说还需要数百万元，王一湖表示不办了，并要求退钱。甘德胜答应退钱，但是陈英母女一直不退钱。</p> \t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">王一湖报警后，甘德胜被抓，但他认为自己只是中间人，没有诈骗。</p> \t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t<div class=\"charges-container\">\t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">甘德胜称，他曾转给一个叫沈某红的女人91万元，让她代为退还给王一湖，但这笔钱被沈私自截留。甘德胜及其亲属更指称，沈某红自称是全国人大常委会法工委某领导的妹妹，出具了上百份盖有公章的“红头文件”，并任命甘德胜为全国人大“下属单位”国家社会调查与经济研究室筹建处负责人。</p> \t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">而陈英母女否认曾帮忙办理取保一事，称甘德胜转给她们的100万元是还款，甘德胜写有借条。对此说法，甘德胜一方并不认可，表示借条是在2023年11月配合陈英倒签的。</p> \t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">北京市朝阳区法院审理认定，甘德胜于2023年8月间，通过他人向被害人王一湖虚构能够帮助其亲属办理取保候审的事实，骗取王一湖100万元，后转给陈英一方用于还款。2026年1月30日，甘德胜因犯诈骗罪被一审判处有期徒刑10年6个月。甘德胜不服上诉，这起离奇的案件7月16日在北京市第三中级法院二审庭审结束，目前未宣判。</p> \t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">甘德胜否认行骗，还称自己被陈英母女以办理军工企业资质的名义骗取近3000万元，被沈某红以筹备“国家社会调查与经济研究室”的名义诈骗1800万元……（文｜财新 冯华妹）</p> \t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">欲知事件始末，请读：<a href=\"https://china.caixin.com/2026-08-28/102478779.html\">https://china.caixin.com/2026-08-28/102478779.html </a></p> \t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWHeader\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWHeader\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/1.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/2.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/3.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/4.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/5.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/6.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/7.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/8.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/9.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/10.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWInner\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWInner\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/11.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"imageBoxG_MWFooter\">\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"articleImageB_MWFooter\" src=\"https://datanews.caixin.com/mobile/article/article_xy/20260920_manwen/12.jpg\" /> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t<p class=\"articleText\">本作品创意和文案由财新传媒真人团队创作，图像和视频成品使用AI工具辅助生成。作品版权属于财新网，不得侵权使用。</p> \t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t</div>\t\t</div>",
          "source": "财新"
        },
